# MCU Project Assistant - Environment Configuration
# Local single-process runtime (S10 architecture: modular monolith, SQLite + workspace files).
# Use this file as a reference for your shell, service manager, or deployment secret store.
# The server does not auto-load a .env file. Set an explicit real AI provider before start;
# it fails closed when provider settings are missing and never silently falls back to mock.

# ─── HTTP Server ────────────────────────────────────────────
# MCU_PORT=3000
# MCU_HOST=127.0.0.1          # loopback-bound for local single-user (Security §5)
# MCU_DEVICE_PROVIDER=companion   # explicit companion or physical path; no implicit fallback
# MCU_BUILD_TIMEOUT_MS=600000      # external compiler hard timeout (10 minutes)
# MCU_ARDUINO_CLI_PATH=arduino-cli  # compiler + physical discovery/upload use the same executable
# MCU_ARDUINO_CLI_CONFIG_PATH=C:/absolute/path/to/arduino-cli.yaml  # optional; required when CLI data/core lives outside its default config directory
# First Reference Kit generated OLED firmware libraries (install into the same CLI config user directory):
#   Adafruit SSD1306@2.5.10, Adafruit GFX Library@1.11.9, Adafruit BusIO@1.17.4

# ─── Persistence ────────────────────────────────────────────
# MCU_DB_PATH=C:/absolute/path/to/mcu.db   # SQLite database (9 tables; migrations in src/adapters/persistence/sqlite/migrations.ts); must be absolute
# MCU_WORKSPACE_DIR=C:/absolute/path/to/workspace  # real artifact files (requirements/, firmware/<NNNN>/…, .build/, .evidence/); must be absolute
# If omitted, the runtime uses application-root/data/mcu.db and application-root/workspace.
# Relative MCU_DB_PATH/MCU_WORKSPACE_DIR values are rejected by the production runtime.

# ─── AI Provider (required) ─────────────────────────────────
# Choose exactly one real provider. Mock adapters are test fixtures only.
#
# SenseNova (OpenAI-compatible; current verified local provider):
# MCU_AI_PROVIDER=sensenova
# SENSENOVA_API_KEY=
# SENSENOVA_BASE_URL=https://token.sensenova.cn/v1
# SENSENOVA_CHAT_MODEL=deepseek-v4-flash
# Optional positive timeout override in milliseconds; omitted means the adapter default.
# SENSENOVA_TIMEOUT_MS=240000
#
# Zhipu GLM:
# MCU_AI_PROVIDER=zhipu
# MCU_ZHIPU_API_KEY=
# MCU_ZHIPU_BASE_URL=https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4
# MCU_ZHIPU_CHAT_MODEL=glm-4.5-flash
